{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ええと、俺はコーヒーにするけど────\r\n透はどうする","trans":"呃，我要咖啡——\n透呢？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017790010","name":"透","text":"え\r\nいいの","trans":"诶\n可以吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いいぞ、プレゼントだ","trans":"可以啊，当礼物","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017790020","name":"透","text":"えー\r\nプレゼント、飲み物かー","trans":"诶——\n礼物是饮料啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"コーヒーじゃない方がいいよな？","trans":"不喝咖啡比较好吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017790040","name":"透","text":"ううん、同じの","trans":"不，要一样的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017790050","name":"透","text":"にがいの、ひとつ","trans":"苦的，一杯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}